WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.560
These are points.

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.740
They come from taking part, never from buying them.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.420
You earn them for the survey, checking in when you visit a place,

00:00:08.539 --> 00:00:11.220
bounties in your city, answering your profile,

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.460
and every friend who joins with your link.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:17.620
Use them to open topic Guides, ask your Guide anything,

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:20.160
or bid on gift cards where the Vault is open.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.680
Or give them to the businesses and nonprofits you believe in.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:27.240
Your level comes from everything you have ever earned,

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.300
so spending never lowers it.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.920
We want to hear from you.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.980
As a member, you shape how points grow:

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:39.200
tell us which rewards you want, which bounties you would take on,

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.820
and let us know if something needs to be fixed.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:43.760
Membership is free.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.080
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.400
and you start with 250 points.

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:51.820
Bring people with you:

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:55.800
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:59.380
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:03.940
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:04.500
community.

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.640
Start earning today.

